@startuml pdf-postprocess
' PostProcessor::process_content — six order-dependent passes, each gated by a flag.
' Render: plantuml -tsvg docs/diagrams/pdf-postprocess.puml
' Source of truth for Figure 3 in docs/components/sources/pdf.md
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam rectangle {
  FontColor white
  FontStyle bold
  BorderColor #263238
  roundCorner 12
}
skinparam ArrowColor #37474F
top to bottom direction

legend top right
|= Concept |= Color |
| postprocessing pass | <back:#EF6C00>        </back> |
| informational only | <back:#00838F>        </back> |
| dead configuration | <back:#455A64>        </back> |
| corruption hazard | <back:#C62828>        </back> |
endlegend

rectangle "**raw LaTeX**\nfrom markdown_to_latex or\nmathpix_markdown_to_latex" as raw #546E7A

rectangle "**① normalize_whitespace**\ncollapse runs of space/tab\ncap consecutive newlines at 2\ndrop CR · trim" as p1 #EF6C00
rectangle "**② fix_ocr_errors**\n26 literal substitutions, in order\n\\bgin{ ⇒ \\begin{ · \\frc{ ⇒ \\frac{\n\\Ieft ⇒ \\left · tabIe ⇒ table" as p2 #EF6C00
rectangle "**③ normalize_math_delimiters**\n$$ … $$ ⇒ \\[ … \\]\nsurround with newlines\ncollapse \\n\\n\\n ⇒ \\n\\n" as p3 #EF6C00
rectangle "**④ fix_brace_matching**\nstack-match { } [ ] ( )\ndrop unmatched closers\nappend missing closers at EOF" as p4 #EF6C00
rectangle "**⑤ remove_artifacts**\nstrip U+FFFD · NUL · BOM\nZWSP · ZWNJ · ZWJ · word-joiner\ncollapse .. and ...." as p5 #EF6C00
rectangle "**⑥ wrap_lines**\nonly when max_line_length > 0\nnever wraps lines starting with \\\nor containing \\[ / \\]" as p6 #EF6C00

rectangle "**validate_latex**\nbrace/bracket/paren balance\nodd '$' count · \\begin vs \\end\n⇒ eprintln! warnings, never an Err" as validate #00838F
rectangle "**PostProcessorConfig::normalize**\nset by normalize_output(bool)\nnever read by process_content" as dead #455A64
rectangle "**half-open intervals**\n[0,1) ⇒ [0,1]\n')' does not match '[' on the stack,\nso it is dropped and ']' is appended" as hazard #C62828

rectangle "**ExtractedDocument**\npages[*].latex and pages[*].markdown\nboth rewritten in place" as out #EF6C00

raw --> p1
p1 --> p2
p2 --> p3
p3 --> p4
p4 --> p5
p5 --> p6
p6 --> out
out --> validate : if validate_latex
p4 -[#C62828,bold]-> hazard : LaTeX ≠ balanced-bracket language
dead -[#455A64,dashed]-> p1 : never consulted
@enduml
